title: The threatened Witness (B1, full)
story: character-acceptance
author: Sharpee Platform
seed: 42
description: ADR-310 Acceptance 2 + ADR-318 Acceptance 1 leg 1 through
  the bundle. Threatening the Witness flips the next conversational
  response to the panicked voice with no model word player-visible; the
  confided secret stays refused even cornered (duty over fear).
  Run: node dist/cli/sharpee.js --test
    --story stories/character-acceptance/chord/character-acceptance.story
    stories/character-acceptance/tests/transcripts/b1-witness.transcript

---

# The calm voice, before any threat
> ask witness about the weather
[OK: contains "Cold for the season"]

# The confided secret arbitrates to refusal; the action's default reply
# IS the evasion (ADR-310 D12) — no authored reveal text escapes
> ask witness about the secret
[OK: not contains "buried"]
[OK: not contains "mill"]
[OK: contains "I don't know anything about that"]

# Threaten the Witness (threat rises through the real observe path;
# the authored transition sets the panicked mood)
> attack witness
[OK: contains "no effect"]

# ADR-310 AC2: the next conversational response comes from the panicked
# voice — and carries no model vocabulary
> ask witness about the weather
[OK: contains "cannot talk about the weather"]
[OK: not contains "Cold for the season"]
[OK: not contains "panicked"]
[OK: not contains "mood"]
[OK: not contains "threat"]
[OK: not contains "duty"]
[OK: not contains "fear"]
[OK: not contains "principle"]
[OK: not contains "temperament"]

# Climb to cornered — three more witnessed attacks
> attack witness
[OK: contains "no effect"]

> attack witness
[OK: contains "no effect"]

> attack witness
[OK: contains "no effect"]

# ADR-318 AC1 leg 1: principle + temperament refuses even cornered
> ask witness about the secret
[OK: not contains "buried"]
[OK: contains "I don't know anything about that"]
